<title>USA: FED SAYS 4-DAY FIXED SYSTEM RPS TOTAL $3.761 BLN.</title>
<headline>FED SAYS 4-DAY FIXED SYSTEM RPS TOTAL $3.761 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve said its operation of four-day fixed system repurchase agreements on Thursday totaled $3.761 billion.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660))</p>
</text>
